TarisOS: the modifiers held on the other keyboards (Ctrl, Alt, Shift, Super) are sent with a Touch
Bar button's keys from tiny-dfr's own device. Hyprland reads the Ctrl+Alt+F-key switch to a text
console with the modifiers of the keyboard the F-key came from alone, so Ctrl+Alt (keyboard) with
F2 (Touch Bar) never switched.

