+// The modifiers held on the other keyboards (Ctrl, Alt, Shift, Super) are sent with a button's keys
+// from this device too: a compositor can read a key with the modifiers of the keyboard it came from
+// alone (Hyprland's Ctrl+Alt+F-key switch to a text console does), and this device has none.
